# Virtual machine integration.
#
# VirtualBox: Debian 13 (trixie) no longer ships virtualbox-guest-utils,
# virtualbox-guest-x11 or virtualbox-guest-dkms in stable, so Guest Additions
# cannot be preinstalled from the Debian archive. Instead the image ships the
# toolchain they need, so they can be built from the host's own
# "Insert Guest Additions CD image" disc, which keeps the version matched to
# the VirtualBox installation in use. See velcora-install-guest-additions.
build-essential
dkms
linux-headers-amd64
perl
bzip2

# QEMU/KVM and SPICE integration.
qemu-guest-agent
spice-vdagent
